WEBVTT

01:33.360 --> 01:34.920
Your sister's off to the capital.

01:35.400 --> 01:37.200
It's not like Tongzhou.

01:37.400 --> 01:39.039
So you take good care of her, all right?

01:39.240 --> 01:40.320
Don't worry, Grandma.

01:42.000 --> 01:44.680
You're very kind, Mother.

01:45.360 --> 01:46.520
I'm humbled.

01:49.080 --> 01:51.240
I know life isn't easy for you.

01:51.600 --> 01:53.039
Just

01:53.680 --> 01:55.560
take care of yourself.

01:56.120 --> 01:57.360
That's the greatest gift

01:57.560 --> 01:58.960
you could ever give me.

02:04.520 --> 02:07.080
I've heard what you've been through

02:07.480 --> 02:09.280
these past few months in the capital.

02:09.759 --> 02:11.560
You're a smart girl.

02:12.160 --> 02:13.520
But remember this.

02:14.120 --> 02:14.920
No matter how hard things get

02:14.920 --> 02:16.960
from now on,

02:17.320 --> 02:18.920
don't ever carry it all alone.

02:19.520 --> 02:21.480
You just let me know.

02:22.320 --> 02:23.480
I will, Grandmother.

02:30.600 --> 02:31.600
Mother.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.120
That Mrs. Ji is finally gone.

02:42.400 --> 02:43.000
Yesterday,

02:43.000 --> 02:44.000
all I wanted was a little piece of that pinkish gauze

02:44.000 --> 02:44.920
for a trim.

02:45.320 --> 02:46.760
The mistress hadn't even said a word,

02:46.920 --> 02:48.400
and she gave me a dirty look instead.

02:48.840 --> 02:49.840
She starts going on about how cold it is

02:49.840 --> 02:50.600
and why would anyone use gauze.

02:50.920 --> 02:52.760
Then she says I don't know the value of anything.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.120
Pfft!

02:56.000 --> 02:56.720
An outsider,

02:56.720 --> 02:57.480
coming into our Gu manor

02:57.480 --> 02:58.440
and telling everyone what to do.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.000
Unbelievable.

03:01.120 --> 03:01.800
Mother,

03:02.360 --> 03:04.200
please don't cross Mrs. Ji.

03:04.600 --> 03:06.280
She's even tougher than the mistress.

03:06.800 --> 03:08.960
And honestly, the fabric thing is secondary.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.120
My coming-of-age ceremony next year

03:10.120 --> 03:11.080
is what really matters.

03:11.680 --> 03:12.840
Have you asked the mistress

03:13.080 --> 03:15.000
how much silver the palace will give?

03:15.960 --> 03:16.880
Well.

03:17.120 --> 03:18.400
My lady asked.

03:18.880 --> 03:20.600
The mistress says by the rules,

03:20.840 --> 03:22.360
the palace can only give two hundred taels.

03:22.720 --> 03:23.880
She'll add another hundred

03:23.880 --> 03:25.120
from her private purse.

03:25.680 --> 03:26.880
So my lady thought

03:27.040 --> 03:28.440
we add seven hundred ourselves,

03:28.680 --> 03:29.640
and make it a thousand.

03:30.920 --> 03:32.320
We can't do that.

03:33.079 --> 03:33.680
You worked so hard

03:33.680 --> 03:34.720
to save that money.

03:34.720 --> 03:36.040
We can't just throw it away.

03:36.680 --> 03:37.520
Besides,

03:37.640 --> 03:38.360
that would only

03:38.360 --> 03:39.800
be a thousand taels.

03:40.079 --> 03:41.079
But I heard that

03:41.079 --> 03:41.880
for my eldest sister's coming-of-age ceremony,

03:41.880 --> 03:42.800
they spent over ten thousand.

03:43.040 --> 03:43.840
Lan,

03:43.960 --> 03:45.079
her coming-of-age ceremony

03:45.280 --> 03:46.440
was all paid for

03:46.440 --> 03:47.800
by the Ji family.

03:48.040 --> 03:49.880
We didn't spend a single tael.

03:55.440 --> 03:57.280
Just because my mother's family isn't powerful,

03:57.440 --> 03:59.000
I'm supposed to keep my head down.

04:00.200 --> 04:01.480
I'm a concubine's daughter as it is.

04:01.680 --> 04:02.600
If my coming-of-age ceremony

04:02.600 --> 04:03.680
is too shabby,

04:04.000 --> 04:05.640
people will only look down on me even more.

04:05.800 --> 04:06.440
And when it's time to find a match,

04:06.440 --> 04:07.960
what kind of good family would want me?

04:08.680 --> 04:11.000
But honestly, my mother's family isn't bad at all.

04:11.280 --> 04:13.000
A fourth-rank official in the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

04:13.360 --> 04:14.320
Even if he's retired,

04:14.560 --> 04:16.040
that's still way better than the Ji family,

04:16.040 --> 04:17.120
who are just merchants.

04:18.079 --> 04:19.560
I don't understand what my mother was thinking.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.959
Just for the sake of Father,

04:21.120 --> 04:22.640
she abandoned her own parents

04:22.960 --> 04:24.400
and married him as a secondary wife.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.400
Miss.

04:27.920 --> 04:29.280
Here's a letter from our young lord.

04:29.560 --> 04:30.880
Could you give it to Miss Gu?

04:32.960 --> 04:33.640
Thank you.

04:34.560 --> 04:35.080
Sure.

04:39.120 --> 04:40.080
Changshun.

04:46.040 --> 04:46.840
Second Miss.

04:47.440 --> 04:48.320
That man just now

04:48.320 --> 04:49.920
was from the Marquis of Changxing's residence, wasn't he?

04:50.440 --> 04:51.720
Miss Ziling, sharp eyes.

04:51.840 --> 04:53.200
Yes, he's from there.

04:53.360 --> 04:54.040
He came

04:54.040 --> 04:55.600
to deliver an invitation to the eldest Miss.

04:59.360 --> 05:00.040
Just as well.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.800
I'm heading to the main house

05:01.800 --> 05:02.760
to find her for dinner.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.160
I'll give it to her for you.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.480
There's only you at the gate.

05:09.680 --> 05:10.600
You can't leave your post.

05:16.120 --> 05:16.720
Fair enough.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.400
Thank you very much, Second Miss.

05:37.400 --> 05:39.200
[Thank you for saving me outside Baoxiang Temple.]

05:39.680 --> 05:40.720
[Tomorrow between 9 and 11 AM,

05:40.720 --> 05:41.800
I will host a banquet at Linxia.]

05:42.120 --> 05:43.200
[I await your arrival.]

05:44.680 --> 05:46.520
[I knew it.]

05:46.520 --> 05:47.600
[There's something between the young lord and my eldest sister.]

05:48.800 --> 05:50.040
This one seems thicker.

05:50.159 --> 05:51.480
Yeah, and the color is nicer too.

05:55.440 --> 05:56.080
Madam.

05:57.560 --> 05:58.880
You wanted to see me?

05:59.400 --> 06:00.240
Yes, come sit down.

06:01.760 --> 06:02.880
I made a few pairs of

06:02.880 --> 06:04.080
knee pads,

06:04.240 --> 06:05.720
all stuffed with goose down.

06:06.000 --> 06:07.640
This pair is for Yao.

06:07.880 --> 06:08.600
And

06:08.600 --> 06:09.960
this one is for Rong.

06:10.320 --> 06:11.840
He's almost back,

06:11.840 --> 06:12.800
isn't he?

06:13.800 --> 06:15.080
And this pair

06:15.640 --> 06:16.840
is for your father.

06:18.640 --> 06:19.800
I've already prepared a calligraphy scroll

06:20.120 --> 06:21.360
for Rong

06:21.800 --> 06:23.320
as a welcoming gift.

06:23.480 --> 06:24.760
You don't need to go out of your way

06:24.760 --> 06:26.240
to prepare anything in my name.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.840
As for Father,

06:29.200 --> 06:30.160
if you want to give him something, just do it.

06:30.480 --> 06:31.920
You don't have to say it's from me.

06:34.159 --> 06:35.840
I understand how you feel.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.400
But

06:38.680 --> 06:40.280
Rong is your own brother.

06:40.640 --> 06:42.040
You didn't grow up together,

06:42.280 --> 06:43.440
so it's easy to be distant.

06:43.760 --> 06:45.760
Antiques and calligraphy

06:46.200 --> 06:47.120
are nice,

06:47.320 --> 06:48.120
but they're also

06:48.120 --> 06:49.560
a bit cold.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.920
Something made by hand

06:51.920 --> 06:53.080
carries more heart.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.200
Right?

06:55.440 --> 06:56.640
As for your father,

06:56.800 --> 06:58.240
he may have his faults,

06:59.240 --> 07:01.040
but he's your own flesh and blood.

07:01.640 --> 07:02.880
If word gets out that you've been cold toward him,

07:03.800 --> 07:05.760
people will only blame you.

07:06.040 --> 07:07.000
And besides,

07:07.440 --> 07:08.920
Your marriage can't wait any longer.

07:09.280 --> 07:10.760
He is an official,

07:10.760 --> 07:12.040
and knows a lot of people.

07:12.600 --> 07:14.800
If he would just help a little,

07:15.160 --> 07:17.000
finding a good match would be much easier.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.880
[Marriage talk again.]

07:20.160 --> 07:20.920
[And the mistress still thinks

07:20.920 --> 07:22.160
he can be counted on.]

07:23.440 --> 07:25.360
Yao has just started at Cunshan Academy.

07:25.440 --> 07:26.840
I wonder how he's doing.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.480
Since the knee pads are already made,

07:28.760 --> 07:29.640
I should send them to him

07:29.640 --> 07:30.920
as soon as possible.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.440
Maybe I'll go to the academy

07:32.440 --> 07:33.560
tomorrow.

07:34.200 --> 07:34.960
Sounds good.

07:45.840 --> 07:46.800
This crossbow is nicely done.

07:47.159 --> 07:48.120
Give him ten taels.

07:48.120 --> 07:48.720
Yes, sir.

07:50.240 --> 07:51.240
Thank you, my lord.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.120
If you can extend the range

07:54.120 --> 07:55.680
another fifty paces,

07:56.480 --> 07:57.800
I'll give you a hundred.

08:00.640 --> 08:02.560
I'll get right on it, my lord.

08:08.160 --> 08:08.800
My lord,

08:09.200 --> 08:11.200
we're supposed to meet Miss Gu at nine.

08:11.400 --> 08:13.320
Shouldn't we go?

08:13.800 --> 08:14.400
What's the rush?

08:15.080 --> 08:16.080
Let her wait.

08:18.400 --> 08:19.080
Yes, my lord.

08:23.520 --> 08:24.280
Fine.

08:24.600 --> 08:25.480
Look at you, so impatient.

08:27.000 --> 08:27.480
Let's go.

08:36.880 --> 08:38.640
It's already an hour past the time.

08:39.400 --> 08:40.440
Why isn't she here yet?

08:41.320 --> 08:42.240
Maybe

08:42.480 --> 08:43.520
she got held up on the way.

08:43.760 --> 08:44.840
It's not far anyway.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.240
Send someone

08:46.520 --> 08:47.560
to the Gu household to meet her.

08:47.920 --> 08:48.640
Yes, sir.

09:07.400 --> 09:07.920
Miss.

09:08.280 --> 09:09.520
I told Luo Gui'er not to wait.

09:09.680 --> 09:10.840
He should find a place out of the wind

09:11.000 --> 09:11.880
and come back in an hour

09:11.880 --> 09:12.840
to pick you up.

09:18.800 --> 09:20.320
Our young lady is Miss Gu.

09:20.560 --> 09:22.720
She's here to see Mr. Chen Xuanqing.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.240
Would you mind letting him know, sir?

09:24.520 --> 09:26.160
Please follow me inside.

09:41.080 --> 09:41.520
My lord.

09:42.240 --> 09:42.720
What happened?

09:43.040 --> 09:43.800
Where's Gu Jinzhao?

09:44.200 --> 09:45.120
Miss Gu,

09:47.360 --> 09:48.360
she went to the academy.

09:54.680 --> 09:56.280
The academy again.

10:00.800 --> 10:01.480
Top Scholar.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.840
A Miss Gu is outside

10:03.840 --> 10:04.560
asking for you.

10:05.080 --> 10:05.760
Miss Gu?

10:06.040 --> 10:06.840
The one

10:06.840 --> 10:08.320
who was here with Ms. Ji last time.

10:09.320 --> 10:11.760
Are you sure she wants to see him?

10:11.760 --> 10:12.560
Not me?

10:13.320 --> 10:14.520
She didn't mention you, sir.

10:14.920 --> 10:16.160
Got it.

10:23.640 --> 10:25.880
The other day, your grandmother and Miss Gu

10:25.880 --> 10:26.720
came to my house.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.800
I lent her a book.

10:29.360 --> 10:31.440
She's probably here to return it.

10:33.800 --> 10:34.800
But I just remembered

10:35.000 --> 10:36.360
the lecturer needs to see me.

10:36.520 --> 10:37.720
He told me to wait for him.

10:37.960 --> 10:39.120
I really can't leave.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.400
So

10:40.560 --> 10:41.080
maybe you could help me out?

10:41.080 --> 10:42.160
Go see Miss Gu

10:42.400 --> 10:43.680
and get the book back for me.

10:44.000 --> 10:44.520
Would you?

10:44.760 --> 10:45.840
I can't go to her.

10:47.400 --> 10:48.520
You know my cousin's temper.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.360
Since she didn't ask for me,

10:51.080 --> 10:52.280
if I showed up,

10:52.760 --> 10:53.840
she'd be furious.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.360
So here's what we do.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.480
Send someone else

10:59.480 --> 11:00.520
to see her.

11:01.000 --> 11:02.000
Tell her you got held up

11:02.000 --> 11:03.280
by the lecturer

11:03.640 --> 11:04.640
and can't come.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.160
Then have her give the book

11:06.160 --> 11:07.360
to that person

11:07.360 --> 11:08.080
to bring back.

11:08.240 --> 11:08.840
What do you think?

11:09.720 --> 11:10.520
Sounds good.

11:25.840 --> 11:27.080
Miss.

11:38.240 --> 11:38.880
Miss Gu.

11:39.600 --> 11:40.600
Mr. Zhang.

11:42.600 --> 11:44.160
Long time no see

11:44.400 --> 11:45.600
since the Chen house.

11:45.920 --> 11:46.560
Anyway,

11:46.760 --> 11:48.000
Xuruo got called away by the lecturer,

11:48.160 --> 11:49.360
won't be back for a while.

11:49.680 --> 11:50.560
He said

11:50.720 --> 11:52.240
you have a book for him.

11:52.600 --> 11:54.160
You can just hand it to me.

11:55.280 --> 11:57.440
So he sent you to pick it up?

11:57.520 --> 11:58.240
That's right.

12:01.640 --> 12:02.960
One moment, please.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.120
Much obliged.

12:20.240 --> 12:21.160
My pleasure.

12:28.440 --> 12:30.240
Well, well. A touching scene of young love.

12:36.520 --> 12:38.040
I thought you were so busy.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.520
Turns out you're here meeting some other man.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.920
Greetings, my lord.

12:42.160 --> 12:43.120
I think you've misunderstood.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.400
I was just...

12:49.200 --> 12:50.440
Are you following me?

12:52.520 --> 12:53.120
Don't

12:53.120 --> 12:54.120
flatter yourself.

12:54.360 --> 12:55.000
I just happened

12:55.320 --> 12:56.320
to pass by

12:56.640 --> 12:57.280
and saw you here,

12:57.280 --> 12:58.280
messing around with a man.

12:58.520 --> 12:59.440
That's all.

13:01.480 --> 13:02.840
So this is the one you've set your sights on?

13:03.080 --> 13:04.200
Nonsense.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.360
Are you cured now

13:06.640 --> 13:07.920
and looking for a fight again?

13:08.800 --> 13:10.240
You saved me once,

13:10.560 --> 13:11.680
and now you think you can walk all over me.

13:12.120 --> 13:12.840
Don't forget,

13:13.040 --> 13:13.960
if it weren't for my help,

13:14.120 --> 13:14.600
you'd already be a married woman

13:14.600 --> 13:15.520
in the Liu family.

13:15.840 --> 13:16.680
So that's why

13:16.680 --> 13:17.720
you didn't want to marry into the Lius.

13:18.720 --> 13:20.080
You went through all that trouble begging for my help.

13:20.560 --> 13:22.080
I thought you had high standards.

13:23.120 --> 13:24.120
But after all that,

13:24.320 --> 13:25.600
this is the kind of man you're after.

13:26.920 --> 13:27.960
No matter how bad your reputation is,

13:28.160 --> 13:28.720
you don't just settle for

13:28.720 --> 13:29.800
the first thing that comes along.

13:30.520 --> 13:31.560
Who I choose

13:31.720 --> 13:33.080
has nothing to do with you, my lord.

13:33.280 --> 13:34.280
But

13:34.760 --> 13:36.160
you are the Crown Prince's companion.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.880
Shouldn't you be with His Highness?

13:37.880 --> 13:39.320
Why do you spend your days following me instead?

13:39.760 --> 13:41.000
If you're well enough,

13:41.280 --> 13:42.720
go back to your duties at the palace.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.480
If you're still unwell

13:44.640 --> 13:46.240
then go home and rest. Leave me alone.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.880
What's the matter?

13:49.120 --> 13:49.960
Upset that I caught you in the act?

13:50.200 --> 13:50.920
Boring.

13:51.400 --> 13:52.920
I have things to do. I'll take my leave.

13:56.600 --> 13:57.720
What are you doing?

14:00.520 --> 14:01.360
Trying to leave, are you?

14:03.400 --> 14:04.120
Li Xianhuai.

14:04.680 --> 14:05.240
Now,

14:06.480 --> 14:07.400
go look into this man.

14:07.960 --> 14:09.040
I want to see

14:09.320 --> 14:10.560
what kind of brilliant scholar

14:11.440 --> 14:12.560
has caught

14:12.560 --> 14:13.600
our Miss Gu's eye.

14:13.960 --> 14:14.520
Yes.

14:14.920 --> 14:15.720
Wait.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.720
My lord, you've misunderstood.

14:18.000 --> 14:19.480
There's nothing between Miss Gu and me.

14:19.840 --> 14:20.400
Miss Gu,

14:21.880 --> 14:22.600
please

14:22.760 --> 14:23.320
explain to the young lord.

14:23.320 --> 14:24.800
Please.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.240
My lord.

14:27.520 --> 14:29.120
Mr. Zhang

14:29.400 --> 14:30.680
has done nothing to you.

14:30.960 --> 14:32.080
Why are you investigating him?

14:32.200 --> 14:33.240
I'll look into whoever I want.

14:33.440 --> 14:34.160
What's it to you?

14:34.360 --> 14:35.000
Li Xianhuai.

14:35.000 --> 14:35.440
Yes.

14:35.640 --> 14:36.240
Wait.

14:37.520 --> 14:38.480
If you have a problem,

14:38.800 --> 14:39.680
take it out on me.

14:39.800 --> 14:41.160
Don't bully Mr. Zhang.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.760
He just passed

14:42.760 --> 14:44.080
the provincial exam,

14:44.840 --> 14:45.920
and

14:45.920 --> 14:47.000
he can't withstand your scrutiny.

14:47.560 --> 14:48.480
If people find out

14:48.640 --> 14:50.120
he's offended you,

14:50.280 --> 14:51.040
they'll

14:51.040 --> 14:51.880
trample him.

14:52.440 --> 14:53.040
How will

14:53.240 --> 14:54.800
he ever take the imperial exams

14:55.360 --> 14:57.240
or become an official?

14:57.760 --> 14:59.760
You're worried about his future.

15:03.680 --> 15:04.680
I remember now.

15:05.840 --> 15:07.040
I've seen you

15:07.040 --> 15:07.560
at Chen Yanyun's place.

15:07.760 --> 15:08.560
Yes, yes.

15:08.720 --> 15:10.600
I had the honor of meeting you, my lord.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.120
Let me ask you something.

15:12.520 --> 15:14.560
If you gave up the imperial exams

15:15.080 --> 15:16.720
and became a staff officer in our marquisate,

15:18.080 --> 15:18.880
would you be willing?

15:19.080 --> 15:20.160
Don't push it too far.

15:20.280 --> 15:21.600
My lord, are you serious?

15:23.400 --> 15:24.560
What if I am?

15:29.040 --> 15:29.840
Mr. Zhang,

15:30.000 --> 15:31.000
what are you doing?

15:31.440 --> 15:32.000
Don't tell me

15:32.000 --> 15:33.520
you're giving up the spring exams?

15:34.520 --> 15:35.400
Miss Gu.

15:36.040 --> 15:37.680
To be honest, passing the provincial exam

15:37.920 --> 15:39.400
was pure luck.

15:39.720 --> 15:40.640
It's all thanks to my ancestors.

15:40.920 --> 15:42.440
I know my own limits.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.960
I have no strength left

15:44.280 --> 15:45.120
for the exam path.

15:45.440 --> 15:46.440
Even if I sat

15:46.720 --> 15:47.640
for the spring exams,

15:47.800 --> 15:49.200
I'd get nowhere.

15:49.640 --> 15:50.880
A fifth rank post

15:51.240 --> 15:52.160
in the marquisate.

15:52.800 --> 15:54.040
Why wouldn't I be willing?

15:54.520 --> 15:55.160
Well,

15:56.440 --> 15:58.840
if I could serve you, my lord,

15:59.080 --> 16:01.120
I would gladly give up the spring exams

16:01.400 --> 16:03.240
and follow your command.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.120
What a shame.

16:15.760 --> 16:17.240
I was just joking.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.280
Why are you taking it so seriously?

16:19.440 --> 16:20.040
You.

16:21.880 --> 16:23.040
How could you do this?

16:25.840 --> 16:26.760
How else could I

16:26.920 --> 16:28.280
show you that

16:28.600 --> 16:31.040
people don't always act the way you expect?

16:31.800 --> 16:33.160
You said if I investigated him,

16:33.400 --> 16:34.480
I'd ruin his exams

16:34.480 --> 16:35.320
and career.

16:35.800 --> 16:36.280
But

16:36.280 --> 16:37.520
this man doesn't even have the confidence

16:37.520 --> 16:38.240
to sit for the spring exams.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.640
I dangled a little bait

16:40.760 --> 16:42.320
and he jumped at it.

16:42.960 --> 16:43.920
With that kind of character,

16:44.360 --> 16:45.360
even if he became an official,

16:45.520 --> 16:47.480
he'd just be a useless seat warmer.

16:48.080 --> 16:48.960
Come to think of it,

16:49.160 --> 16:50.320
I just happened

16:50.440 --> 16:51.680
to uncover a mediocre talent

16:51.680 --> 16:52.440
for the court.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.520
How wonderful.

16:55.960 --> 16:56.400
You.

16:57.120 --> 16:57.520
You.

17:06.200 --> 17:07.240
Oh no!

17:08.520 --> 17:09.240
What is it?

17:09.240 --> 17:09.920
What happened?

17:10.079 --> 17:11.560
Mr. Zhang got into a fight

17:11.720 --> 17:12.839
and coughed up blood.

17:13.079 --> 17:14.480
He's been taken to a clinic.

17:15.800 --> 17:16.640
What?

17:20.800 --> 17:21.839
Why are you staring at me?

17:22.440 --> 17:23.720
How was I supposed to know he's that fragile?

17:24.280 --> 17:24.880
You're not blaming me for this,

17:24.880 --> 17:25.839
are you?

17:26.319 --> 17:27.839
Who would dare blame you, my lord?

17:28.319 --> 17:29.160
You're

17:29.400 --> 17:30.640
from a noble house.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.120
Raised in privilege your whole life.

17:32.480 --> 17:33.720
Of course you wouldn't understand.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.280
A casual promise from you

17:35.480 --> 17:36.440
is a chance most people couldn't earn

17:36.440 --> 17:37.720
in several lifetimes.

17:38.080 --> 17:39.200
And

17:39.520 --> 17:41.120
a casual retraction from you

17:41.600 --> 17:42.360
is enough

17:42.360 --> 17:43.360
to make a man cough up blood.

17:43.760 --> 17:44.440
Maybe

17:44.720 --> 17:45.720
even kill him.

17:45.960 --> 17:46.760
What are you talking about?

17:47.680 --> 17:48.480
In fact,

17:48.760 --> 17:50.600
people your age

17:51.080 --> 17:52.160
are either working the fields,

17:52.360 --> 17:53.400
studying by candlelight,

17:53.640 --> 17:54.800
or fighting at the front.

17:55.120 --> 17:56.200
Working their fingers to the bone

17:56.200 --> 17:57.040
to feed their families.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.080
But you?

17:59.280 --> 18:00.600
You eat, drink, and entertain yourself all day.

18:00.800 --> 18:01.560
Lazy and wandering.

18:01.720 --> 18:02.960
Living off your ancestors' glory.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.040
Producing nothing.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.920
You contribute nothing to the country or its people.

18:06.120 --> 18:06.800
How dare you speak to me like that!

18:14.600 --> 18:15.200
Miss.

18:15.280 --> 18:15.880
Jinzhao.

18:16.160 --> 18:16.760
- Stop it.
- Jinzhao.

18:16.760 --> 18:17.280
Miss.

18:23.520 --> 18:24.920
This academy is a place of sages.

18:25.240 --> 18:25.880
How dare you act so recklessly,

18:26.240 --> 18:27.760
my lord?

18:28.200 --> 18:29.320
You dare hurt our young lady?

18:29.480 --> 18:30.080
- Insolent!
- Qingpu.

18:33.200 --> 18:33.880
Ms. Chen.

18:34.360 --> 18:35.000
Second Brother.

18:35.440 --> 18:36.400
Let him go.

18:37.080 --> 18:38.360
He's just a madman.

18:39.040 --> 18:40.640
It's not worth going against him.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.240
Enough.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.920
Let's take care of your injury first.

19:59.960 --> 20:01.640
Split it fifty-fifty.

20:03.480 --> 20:04.760
So by my math,

20:05.440 --> 20:06.520
we only need

20:06.520 --> 20:07.240
another hundred and fifty taels.

20:08.760 --> 20:09.600
Or

20:10.120 --> 20:11.080
let's make it an even two hundred.

20:11.760 --> 20:12.920
But here's the thing.

20:13.440 --> 20:15.240
You and your sister didn't grow up together.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.160
Might feel a bit distant.

20:17.800 --> 20:19.200
Distance isn't a problem.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.560
The more distant,

20:20.960 --> 20:22.200
the more expensive the meeting gift has to be.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.400
Why else would I spend five taels

20:23.400 --> 20:25.000
on that jade bracelet?

20:25.280 --> 20:26.600
It's for the eldest sister.

20:27.760 --> 20:29.400
It's called fishing, get it?

20:30.160 --> 20:31.800
She'll have to give something back.

20:32.200 --> 20:33.680
Gold, jade,

20:33.680 --> 20:34.640
antiques or calligraphy,

20:34.960 --> 20:35.800
as long as it's worth more than two hundred taels,

20:36.120 --> 20:36.960
I win.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.080
The eldest miss is loaded.

20:39.600 --> 20:41.480
Maybe

20:41.680 --> 20:42.840
she could even take care of that little matter

20:43.040 --> 20:43.760
for us without breaking a sweat.

20:43.760 --> 20:44.240
Shut up.

20:44.880 --> 20:45.320
Yes, sir.

20:46.360 --> 20:47.120
I'm an idiot.

20:47.440 --> 20:48.080
- That matter.
- I'm an idiot.

20:48.080 --> 20:49.200
Not a word of it must ever get out.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.400
You hear me?

20:51.640 --> 20:52.360
Understood.

20:52.760 --> 20:53.720
I promise I won't say a thing.

20:53.920 --> 20:54.960
I promise.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.320
Not a word

21:02.320 --> 21:03.320
about what happened today.

21:03.640 --> 21:04.360
Yes, miss.

21:06.640 --> 21:07.680
Miss,

21:07.960 --> 21:09.000
hurry to the main house.

21:09.000 --> 21:10.120
Young Master Rong has returned.

21:10.320 --> 21:11.040
Wasn't he not coming

21:11.880 --> 21:13.920
until the end of the month?

21:15.840 --> 21:16.880
Go tell the mistress

21:17.080 --> 21:18.640
I'll be there as soon as I change my clothes.

21:18.840 --> 21:19.400
Yes, miss.

21:24.520 --> 21:25.320
Mother.

21:27.400 --> 21:29.240
How did you get so thin?

21:29.680 --> 21:31.440
Your cheeks are sunken in.

21:32.320 --> 21:34.080
Have you been studying too hard?

21:34.320 --> 21:35.800
The eldest miss and the second miss are here.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.440
I'll have to fatten you up.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.360
Rong.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.080
Greetings,

21:46.520 --> 21:47.440
big sister.

21:48.600 --> 21:50.000
You've grown so tall.

21:50.360 --> 21:51.560
Quite the handsome young man.

21:52.000 --> 21:52.840
Big sister, you're beautiful too.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.040
Like someone out of a painting.

21:55.960 --> 21:56.760
Second sister.

21:58.000 --> 21:58.800
You're back.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.600
Everyone, please sit.

22:05.720 --> 22:07.120
Weren't you coming back at the end of the month?

22:07.280 --> 22:08.400
Why the early return?

22:08.600 --> 22:09.600
That was the plan,

22:09.840 --> 22:10.720
but the teacher suddenly came down

22:10.720 --> 22:11.800
with a bad cough,

22:11.920 --> 22:12.920
so he let us out early.

22:14.000 --> 22:14.600
I wrote about it

22:14.600 --> 22:15.760
in my letter to second sister.

22:16.000 --> 22:17.040
Didn't she tell you?

22:19.200 --> 22:19.680
I thought

22:19.680 --> 22:21.040
you wrote to Mother as well.

22:21.440 --> 22:22.080
So

22:22.280 --> 22:23.720
you only wrote to me.

22:26.160 --> 22:27.240
It's my fault,

22:27.240 --> 22:27.840
big sister.

22:28.040 --> 22:29.480
should have told you.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.080
No harm done.

22:31.360 --> 22:32.680
Either way,

22:32.680 --> 22:34.240
Huaiyuan is all ready for you.

22:35.880 --> 22:36.840
Did you bring gifts

22:36.840 --> 22:38.680
for your sisters?

22:38.760 --> 22:39.280
Yes.

22:39.400 --> 22:39.920
Shuangli.

22:42.720 --> 22:43.480
Big sister.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.080
This one is for you.

22:46.040 --> 22:47.120
That's thoughtful of you.

22:53.120 --> 22:53.840
I just picked it at random.

22:54.040 --> 22:55.240
The luster looked good,

22:55.360 --> 22:56.080
but I wasn't sure

22:56.080 --> 22:57.320
if it would suit you.

23:01.160 --> 23:01.880
It's perfect.

23:02.120 --> 23:02.920
Thank you.

23:03.280 --> 23:04.120
I'm glad.

23:08.280 --> 23:10.360
What a beautiful ivory concentric ball.

23:11.120 --> 23:12.840
You actually carved it?

23:15.640 --> 23:16.360
Did you carve this

23:16.560 --> 23:17.640
yourself?

23:17.640 --> 23:18.360
Yes.

23:18.480 --> 23:20.080
Mother, look.

23:21.320 --> 23:22.960
- Let me see.
- It wasn't that hard.

23:23.240 --> 23:24.120
No,

23:24.120 --> 23:25.520
but what matters is the thought behind it.

23:25.840 --> 23:26.440
That's worth

23:26.440 --> 23:27.760
more than any gold or jade.

23:28.040 --> 23:29.480
Last time,

23:29.680 --> 23:30.960
I mentioned

23:31.160 --> 23:33.000
I wanted an ivory concentric ball.

23:33.160 --> 23:34.240
He said he'd make me one.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.240
I never thought

23:35.240 --> 23:36.480
he'd actually pull it off.

23:37.600 --> 23:38.240
Who would have guessed

23:38.240 --> 23:39.480
you had such skill?

23:41.080 --> 23:42.160
I made another one.

23:42.360 --> 23:43.480
This one is for you.

23:43.640 --> 23:45.000
But it's not finished yet.

23:45.200 --> 23:45.800
Once it's done,

23:45.800 --> 23:46.840
I'll bring it to you.

23:48.520 --> 23:50.440
I have a gift for you too.

23:50.960 --> 23:51.600
Qingpu.

23:56.240 --> 23:57.200
Go on, open it.

24:07.080 --> 24:07.920
What is it?

24:13.280 --> 24:14.520
It's a pair of knee pads.

24:14.960 --> 24:15.960
It's getting cold.

24:16.200 --> 24:17.640
You can wear them when you write.

24:18.280 --> 24:19.520
Your sister is so thoughtful.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.200
She made these

24:21.200 --> 24:22.640
herself.

24:26.200 --> 24:27.400
It's not gold or jade.

24:28.080 --> 24:29.000
Just a little something from the heart.

24:38.520 --> 24:39.200
Miss,

24:39.200 --> 24:40.680
didn't you already give him a pair of knee pads?

24:41.360 --> 24:42.960
Why add this painting?

24:46.080 --> 24:47.440
You saw it yourself.

24:47.560 --> 24:48.840
The moment he saw those knee pads,

24:49.040 --> 24:50.400
his smile froze.

24:51.040 --> 24:52.440
Clearly, he didn't like them.

24:54.080 --> 24:55.080
So

24:55.200 --> 24:56.440
I might as well

24:56.440 --> 24:57.240
give him this rooster fighting painting.

24:57.960 --> 24:59.520
It was meant for him anyway.

25:00.360 --> 25:02.000
Miss, you're so good to Mr. Ji.

25:03.280 --> 25:04.800
But from what I can see,

25:05.000 --> 25:05.960
he seems closer

25:05.960 --> 25:08.000
to the second young lady.

25:08.880 --> 25:10.400
They grew up together.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.280
Of course

25:12.280 --> 25:13.480
he's closer to her than to me.

25:20.240 --> 25:21.520
You actually carved a concentric ball

25:21.680 --> 25:22.880
for the eldest sister?

25:23.280 --> 25:24.520
As if I have that much free time.

25:24.760 --> 25:26.000
I just said it in passing.

25:26.320 --> 25:27.120
It's all your fault.

25:27.480 --> 25:28.120
Why did you have to show off

25:28.120 --> 25:29.480
in front of her?

25:29.880 --> 25:31.080
I wasn't showing off.

25:31.760 --> 25:33.320
I was just happy

25:33.320 --> 25:34.520
and said too much.

25:35.160 --> 25:36.560
Anyway, she didn't say anything.

25:37.920 --> 25:39.040
Yeah.

25:39.280 --> 25:40.200
But all she gave me

25:40.200 --> 25:41.040
was a lousy pair of knee pads.

25:43.920 --> 25:44.760
So,

25:44.760 --> 25:46.400
you've been sucking up to her

25:46.560 --> 25:47.520
because

25:47.520 --> 25:48.880
you're hoping for something expensive in return.

25:49.520 --> 25:50.720
Isn't that fair?

25:51.080 --> 25:52.120
I went to all that trouble

25:52.120 --> 25:53.160
picking out that bracelet for her.

25:54.040 --> 25:54.800
And

25:54.880 --> 25:55.520
she fobs me off

25:55.520 --> 25:56.520
with cheap knee pads.

25:58.640 --> 26:00.520
Look at you, counting every penny.

26:03.400 --> 26:04.000
Well,

26:04.040 --> 26:04.840
let me ask you something.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.160
Do you have any spare money

26:07.160 --> 26:08.240
lately?

26:08.560 --> 26:09.280
No.

26:10.400 --> 26:11.800
You haven't even heard how much.

26:12.520 --> 26:13.800
I don't have any.

26:14.200 --> 26:15.760
I only get two taels a month.

26:15.880 --> 26:17.400
Barely enough for face powder and hair oil.

26:17.880 --> 26:19.280
What do you need the money for?

26:20.400 --> 26:21.040
I.

26:22.240 --> 26:23.160
Nothing.

26:23.160 --> 26:23.920
I have my reasons.

26:24.280 --> 26:25.080
What reasons?

26:26.120 --> 26:27.200
Well, since you don't have any to lend,

26:27.200 --> 26:27.960
don't ask.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.080
Miss,

26:37.240 --> 26:39.160
why is Ms. Ji so short of money?

26:39.640 --> 26:41.040
He even borrowed from the second young lady.

26:42.040 --> 26:44.080
He's still studying,

26:44.600 --> 26:45.640
no drinking,

26:46.000 --> 26:47.080
no parties.

26:47.560 --> 26:48.200
He shouldn't

26:48.200 --> 26:49.480
need that much.

26:51.800 --> 26:52.280
Anyway,

26:52.760 --> 26:54.040
none of my business.

26:57.320 --> 26:58.400
Miss,

26:58.600 --> 26:59.360
are we still giving him the painting?

26:59.680 --> 27:00.800
Of course not.

27:01.560 --> 27:02.880
I'm not going to beg her.

27:04.640 --> 27:05.440
Besides,

27:05.920 --> 27:07.000
a good painting like this

27:07.280 --> 27:08.520
is better off with me.

27:10.160 --> 27:11.160
Be careful, miss.

27:11.160 --> 27:12.680
Your arm is still hurt.

27:15.040 --> 27:15.600
Oh, right.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.360
Go get that outfit

27:17.360 --> 27:18.360
I was wearing.

27:37.200 --> 27:38.280
What are you looking for?

27:43.880 --> 27:44.600
The notes

27:45.240 --> 27:46.280
I wrote in that book

27:46.280 --> 27:47.280
I borrowed from Mr. Chen.

27:47.560 --> 27:48.920
I took them out

27:49.160 --> 27:50.560
and hid them in my sleeve.

27:51.680 --> 27:52.440
Then Ye Xian hit me

27:52.920 --> 27:54.600
with his whip.

27:55.000 --> 27:55.760
And now

27:55.960 --> 27:57.040
they're gone.

28:15.560 --> 28:17.360
[That feeling of being a guest in your own home.]

28:17.760 --> 28:19.160
[I know it well.]

28:19.840 --> 28:21.400
[Whenever it gets me down,

28:21.600 --> 28:22.840
I cheer myself up.]

28:23.480 --> 28:25.920
[Being a guest in your own home isn't all bad.]

28:26.680 --> 28:27.840
[Since I'm the guest,

28:28.320 --> 28:30.120
if anyone asks to borrow money,

28:30.440 --> 28:31.720
absolutely not.]

28:32.600 --> 28:33.880
[The most important thing

28:34.280 --> 28:35.120
in life

28:35.720 --> 28:37.480
is learning to comfort yourself.]

28:38.880 --> 28:40.360
[Every night, tell yourself:

28:40.920 --> 28:42.440
blame yourself less,

28:43.080 --> 28:44.400
find others' faults more.]

28:45.320 --> 28:46.480
[If that doesn't work,

28:47.040 --> 28:48.440
go to Linxia,

28:48.840 --> 28:49.760
order a feast,

28:50.400 --> 28:51.560
and eat.]

28:54.840 --> 28:55.800
[Still unhappy?]

28:56.200 --> 28:57.320
[Eat again.]

28:57.960 --> 28:59.560
[Until you're stuffed

29:00.360 --> 29:01.560
and can't think straight.]

29:44.480 --> 29:45.200
In fact,

29:45.680 --> 29:47.400
people your age

29:47.960 --> 29:49.120
are either working the fields,

29:49.280 --> 29:50.280
studying by candlelight,

29:50.560 --> 29:51.840
or fighting at the front.

29:52.160 --> 29:53.280
Working their fingers to the bone

29:53.280 --> 29:54.120
to feed their families.

29:54.520 --> 29:55.880
But you?

29:56.080 --> 29:57.240
You eat, drink, and entertain yourself all day.

29:57.560 --> 29:58.440
Lazy and wandering.

29:59.200 --> 30:00.520
Living off your ancestors' glory.

30:00.520 --> 30:01.400
Producing nothing.

30:01.560 --> 30:03.440
You contribute nothing to the country or its people.

30:17.200 --> 30:17.760
My lord,

30:17.920 --> 30:18.920
we should be going.

30:35.120 --> 30:36.040
Let him go.

30:36.880 --> 30:38.080
He's just a madman.

30:38.720 --> 30:40.240
It's not worth going against him.

30:53.360 --> 30:53.920
My lord,

30:54.280 --> 30:55.040
the next guests

30:55.040 --> 30:56.000
will be here any moment.

30:56.200 --> 30:56.960
Linxia has already been booked

30:56.960 --> 30:58.400
by someone else.

30:58.800 --> 30:59.720
Why don't you ask the young lord

30:59.720 --> 31:01.080
to clear the place?

31:01.200 --> 31:02.800
Who told you to ask me to clear out?

31:03.560 --> 31:04.120
My lord.

31:05.680 --> 31:06.240
My lord.

31:06.600 --> 31:07.480
Yes, you.

31:07.480 --> 31:08.720
You want me to move?

31:09.840 --> 31:10.360
Get lost.

31:10.640 --> 31:11.160
But.

31:14.800 --> 31:15.560
Ms. Chen.

31:15.680 --> 31:16.720
My respects to you.

31:21.480 --> 31:22.520
Young lord.

31:23.400 --> 31:25.320
So you're the one who wants me to move?

31:27.280 --> 31:28.920
Where?

31:30.480 --> 31:32.280
You think I don't want to?

31:33.720 --> 31:34.320
You think

31:34.320 --> 31:36.160
I enjoy eating, drinking,

31:36.240 --> 31:37.440
and lazing around all day?

31:39.240 --> 31:40.000
Do you think

31:40.000 --> 31:41.040
you know me so well?

31:41.440 --> 31:42.360
Gu Jinzhao,

31:54.200 --> 31:55.200
you don't know a damn thing.

31:55.320 --> 31:55.640
My lord,

31:55.920 --> 31:56.600
let's go back.

31:56.600 --> 31:57.360
Get out of my way.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.600
You don't understand anything.

32:16.160 --> 32:16.720
Teacher.

32:22.960 --> 32:24.320
How's your injury?

32:28.880 --> 32:30.320
I didn't mean to hurt you.

32:31.560 --> 32:32.320
Let me see.

32:35.920 --> 32:37.240
Who is that man?

32:37.840 --> 32:39.480
Ye Xian, heir to Marquis Changxing.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.320
Does it still hurt?

32:42.640 --> 32:44.320
Isn't that the one with the heart condition

32:44.440 --> 32:46.120
who can't join the army?

32:46.600 --> 32:48.240
Can't ride a horse,

32:48.240 --> 32:49.000
can't fight.

32:49.200 --> 32:51.000
If he never earns any merit,

32:51.400 --> 32:53.480
he might not get the title.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.800
Then the Changxing line

32:56.200 --> 32:57.160
would die out.

32:58.320 --> 32:58.920
Why doesn't he

32:58.920 --> 33:00.000
just have more sons then?

33:00.200 --> 33:01.560
You think he hasn't tried?

33:01.800 --> 33:03.080
It's not that he won't,

33:03.720 --> 33:05.360
it's that he can't.

33:07.000 --> 33:07.800
How dare you!

33:14.120 --> 33:14.920
Take them back.

33:15.040 --> 33:15.560
Yes, sir.

33:16.360 --> 33:16.800
My lord.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.160
Let's go.

33:23.240 --> 33:23.800
Come on, my lord.

33:24.080 --> 33:24.720
Please.

33:25.200 --> 33:26.040
Let's go home.

33:27.160 --> 33:27.720
Teacher.

33:28.240 --> 33:28.800
This way.

33:36.880 --> 33:37.920
Jiuheng,

33:38.200 --> 33:40.000
since you manage the Eastern Palace,

33:40.560 --> 33:41.960
tell me,

33:42.440 --> 33:44.480
what do you really think of Ye Xian?

33:44.480 --> 33:45.760
I hear

33:46.080 --> 33:48.360
he gets along quite well with His Highness.

33:53.280 --> 33:54.560
I was about to say, teacher.

33:55.760 --> 33:56.880
In my view,

33:57.560 --> 33:58.720
Ye Xian shouldn't

33:59.520 --> 34:01.160
stay close to His Highness.

34:06.160 --> 34:06.640
Come on, eat.

34:22.320 --> 34:24.120
This classmate of mine grew up poor.

34:24.679 --> 34:25.960
After the new year,

34:26.199 --> 34:27.560
his sister is getting married to some local rich man.

34:28.080 --> 34:28.800
He's worried her dowry

34:28.800 --> 34:29.679
will be too shabby

34:29.800 --> 34:30.679
and she'll be looked down on.

34:31.080 --> 34:32.040
So he came to us for a loan.

34:32.520 --> 34:33.280
Mother never likes

34:33.280 --> 34:34.520
getting involved in such things.

34:34.639 --> 34:35.639
And Father is even worse.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.679
I don't have any money myself.

34:38.120 --> 34:38.880
So

34:38.880 --> 34:40.120
I had to come to you.

34:40.719 --> 34:41.800
How much do you need?

34:42.320 --> 34:42.960
Two hundred taels.

34:43.480 --> 34:44.320
That much?

34:45.800 --> 34:47.239
That's not a small sum.

34:47.960 --> 34:49.120
Give me a few days.

34:49.120 --> 34:50.280
Let me see what I can scrape together.

34:50.600 --> 34:51.080
All right?

34:53.320 --> 34:53.840
I.

35:00.200 --> 35:00.760
Well.

35:01.600 --> 35:02.440
Alright then.

35:03.240 --> 35:04.080
I'll be going now.

35:17.840 --> 35:18.320
Miss,

35:19.200 --> 35:20.880
Yunting from Mr. Chen's side is here.

35:21.200 --> 35:22.280
He said

35:22.280 --> 35:23.520
the seventeenth is Mr. Chen's birthday,

35:23.640 --> 35:25.080
and he'd like to invite you.

35:25.680 --> 35:27.520
He also wants to know

35:27.520 --> 35:28.200
how your injury is doing.

35:28.320 --> 35:29.040
Really?

35:29.920 --> 35:31.080
He actually said

35:31.080 --> 35:32.560
the seventeenth is his birthday?

35:37.000 --> 35:38.600
But that day at the academy,

35:39.000 --> 35:40.040
he was right there,

35:40.920 --> 35:42.480
yet he sent someone else to see me.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.160
Now he's inviting me himself.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.360
I don't know what to make of it.

35:47.960 --> 35:48.920
Maybe last time,

35:48.920 --> 35:50.480
he couldn't come out

35:50.840 --> 35:52.200
to see you alone

35:52.200 --> 35:53.320
because your brother was around.

35:54.240 --> 35:55.200
I think so too.

35:56.160 --> 35:57.880
Then have Yunting ask him.

35:58.120 --> 35:59.440
We'll meet

35:59.720 --> 36:00.680
on Yong'an Bridge.

36:00.760 --> 36:01.360
okay?

36:01.920 --> 36:02.920
I'll go ask him.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.320
My lady wants to meet

36:07.480 --> 36:08.320
on Yong'an Bridge

36:08.320 --> 36:09.440
on the seventeenth.

36:11.960 --> 36:12.520
Got it.

36:25.480 --> 36:27.000
Young Master Rong is here.

36:38.240 --> 36:39.800
How are you managing this room?

36:39.960 --> 36:41.040
Not even a cup of water.

36:49.760 --> 36:50.600
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

36:58.520 --> 36:59.640
Idiot! Idiot!

37:00.040 --> 37:01.280
Are you trying to burn me alive?

37:01.360 --> 37:02.000
Forgive me, my lord.

37:13.160 --> 37:13.960
Hot?

37:14.120 --> 37:15.480
Then let it cool down.

37:16.240 --> 37:17.200
What's the rush?

37:17.560 --> 37:18.560
Who put you in a bad mood?

37:18.560 --> 37:19.720
You come here to take it out on me.

37:20.800 --> 37:22.000
Don't ask.

37:24.480 --> 37:25.320
Let me guess.

37:25.920 --> 37:27.000
Father's not home.

37:27.200 --> 37:28.320
Mother spoils you too much

37:28.320 --> 37:29.640
to let you suffer.

37:31.000 --> 37:32.320
So,

37:32.600 --> 37:33.560
it must be eldest sister?

37:36.160 --> 37:37.080
Bingo.

37:37.600 --> 37:38.280
No wonder.

37:38.440 --> 37:39.360
Actually,

37:39.360 --> 37:40.320
no one dares cross her.

37:40.800 --> 37:41.760
She doesn't even put Father

37:41.760 --> 37:42.880
in his place.

37:43.080 --> 37:44.400
You'd better stop provoking her.

37:46.760 --> 37:47.440
Why should I?

37:47.960 --> 37:49.040
She's the eldest miss, sure,

37:49.040 --> 37:50.280
but I'm the eldest young master of the Gu family.

37:51.920 --> 37:53.120
What happened?

37:53.800 --> 37:54.760
Tell me.

37:55.840 --> 37:57.720
Why bring up something so shameful?

37:59.560 --> 38:00.440
Miss! Miss!

38:03.680 --> 38:04.840
Young Master Rong.

38:05.440 --> 38:06.520
What...

38:08.240 --> 38:09.360
Where have you been all morning?

38:09.640 --> 38:10.560
Not a proper person

38:10.560 --> 38:11.200
in the room.

38:11.800 --> 38:12.680
And because of that,

38:12.680 --> 38:13.560
our young master burned his mouth on tea.

38:13.640 --> 38:14.880
Now he's throwing a tantrum at me.

38:15.560 --> 38:16.200
Miss.

38:21.320 --> 38:22.200
What's going on?

38:22.360 --> 38:23.480
Why so secretive?

38:31.360 --> 38:32.280
Did you hear clearly?

38:32.360 --> 38:33.680
Every word.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.640
I just heard something

38:40.040 --> 38:41.120
about eldest sister.

38:41.560 --> 38:43.040
I'm not interested in her business.

38:43.920 --> 38:45.000
Not interested at all?

38:45.800 --> 38:46.640
This person

38:46.640 --> 38:47.360
might just become

38:47.360 --> 38:48.520
our brother-in-law someday.

38:49.520 --> 38:50.160
What?

38:51.400 --> 38:52.240
Brother-in-law?

38:53.400 --> 38:53.960
Who?

38:55.680 --> 38:57.080
Chen Xuanqing.

39:04.200 --> 39:05.200
On Yong'an Bridge.

39:07.520 --> 39:09.240
That new bridge

39:09.840 --> 39:11.040
I haven't seen it yet.

39:11.960 --> 39:12.480
Great.

39:12.920 --> 39:13.400
Alright then.

39:13.840 --> 39:14.560
I'll go give Miss Qingpu an answer

39:14.560 --> 39:15.560
in a bit.

39:15.800 --> 39:17.000
Miss Qingpu said

39:17.200 --> 39:18.240
Miss Gu is already thinking about

39:18.240 --> 39:19.680
what birthday gift to get you.

39:20.760 --> 39:21.520
You told her

39:21.520 --> 39:22.360
my birthday?

39:22.600 --> 39:23.080
Yes.

39:23.440 --> 39:25.200
You're meeting Miss Gu on the seventeenth.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.880
Isn't that because

39:27.200 --> 39:28.120
you want to spend your birthday with her?

39:28.320 --> 39:28.920
I picked the seventeenth

39:28.920 --> 39:30.400
because the academy is closed that day.

39:30.560 --> 39:31.080
You.

39:32.560 --> 39:33.160
Anyway,

39:33.360 --> 39:34.800
it's already said.

39:35.280 --> 39:36.320
I think

39:36.440 --> 39:37.640
Miss Gu is quite nice.

39:37.920 --> 39:38.680
Pretty,

39:39.000 --> 39:39.760
wealthy,

39:40.080 --> 39:41.400
and generous.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.480
Way better

39:43.600 --> 39:44.680
than those noble ladies.

39:46.240 --> 39:46.800
Enough.

39:47.880 --> 39:48.760
That's a young lady.

39:49.240 --> 39:50.360
Don't gossip about her like that behind her back.

39:51.480 --> 39:52.120
I'll head back now.

39:52.120 --> 39:52.640
Wait.

39:52.960 --> 39:53.400
Wait,

39:53.840 --> 39:54.560
you forgot.

39:54.880 --> 39:55.640
Today the old lady

39:55.640 --> 39:56.840
asked you to come home.

39:58.800 --> 39:59.160
Right.

39:59.640 --> 40:00.040
I forgot.

40:00.240 --> 40:00.600
Let's go.

40:05.200 --> 40:07.120
Ever since you became a Top Scholar,

40:07.600 --> 40:09.080
people have been lining up

40:09.080 --> 40:10.560
to propose.

40:11.040 --> 40:12.280
I know

40:12.640 --> 40:13.760
many well-bred young ladies

40:14.040 --> 40:16.200
in the capital

40:17.080 --> 40:18.920
have their eye on you.

40:20.080 --> 40:20.840
Grandmother.

40:21.880 --> 40:22.680
I.

40:22.680 --> 40:24.280
Never mind.

40:25.040 --> 40:26.080
What do you think of

40:26.840 --> 40:29.000
Yu Wanxue?

40:30.280 --> 40:32.760
The Yu family may not be as high ranked as ours,

40:33.480 --> 40:35.720
but they've been scholars for generations.

40:36.960 --> 40:38.360
Your uncle Yu

40:38.640 --> 40:40.520
is a man of pure character.

40:41.600 --> 40:42.960
He and your third uncle

40:43.160 --> 40:45.240
have been close friends for years.

40:45.480 --> 40:47.440
We know each other well.

40:47.920 --> 40:48.880
And

40:49.480 --> 40:50.600
Wanxue

40:51.080 --> 40:53.680
is a rare, fine young lady.

40:54.400 --> 40:55.520
What do you say?

40:57.080 --> 40:58.200
Well,

40:58.520 --> 40:59.800
what does third uncle think?

41:00.360 --> 41:02.520
He's the one who picked her.

41:03.600 --> 41:05.080
And I agree.

41:05.960 --> 41:07.800
It does seem like a good match.

41:08.480 --> 41:10.320
As for the Yu family,

41:10.760 --> 41:12.400
they want to wait until after the new year

41:12.600 --> 41:14.200
to exchange the birth certificates.

41:14.880 --> 41:15.880
But of course,

41:17.640 --> 41:20.320
you have to have your say.

41:20.680 --> 41:22.920
It's your marriage.

41:34.920 --> 41:35.480
My lord,

41:35.800 --> 41:36.840
you're finally awake.

41:39.640 --> 41:40.800
What time is it?

41:40.960 --> 41:41.880
Just past nine in the morning.

41:42.200 --> 41:43.440
You drank too much yesterday.

41:43.600 --> 41:43.960
You slept

41:43.960 --> 41:45.120
a full fourteen hours.

41:50.920 --> 41:52.400
What about Gu Jinzhao?

41:53.680 --> 41:54.400
Greetings, my lady.

41:54.680 --> 41:55.440
Xian,

41:56.120 --> 41:57.280
you just woke up?

41:59.200 --> 41:59.920
Someone come.

42:00.200 --> 42:01.640
Help him wash up.

42:01.880 --> 42:03.560
And pack a few changes of clothes.

42:03.920 --> 42:04.360
Yes.

42:05.040 --> 42:05.520
Xian,

42:05.640 --> 42:06.360
I've already sent word

42:06.360 --> 42:07.440
to your sister.

42:07.760 --> 42:08.720
You'll go over there in a bit

42:09.040 --> 42:10.400
and stay at Daxin for a few days.

42:12.560 --> 42:13.480
What happened?

42:13.760 --> 42:15.240
Your father just returned from court.

42:15.480 --> 42:16.080
His Majesty dismissed you

42:16.080 --> 42:17.720
from your post as the Crown Prince's companion.

42:17.960 --> 42:18.400
What?

42:18.400 --> 42:18.840
This.

42:20.040 --> 42:21.000
Did you ask Father

42:21.000 --> 42:22.120
to beg His Majesty?

42:22.320 --> 42:24.080
No, of course not.

42:24.480 --> 42:26.080
I did think about it before,

42:26.400 --> 42:27.440
but you didn't want it.

42:27.760 --> 42:28.880
Your father also said

42:29.120 --> 42:30.080
it was a good path.

42:30.080 --> 42:31.200
So

42:31.400 --> 42:32.560
I dropped it.

42:33.160 --> 42:34.040
But

42:34.320 --> 42:35.040
who would have guessed that

42:35.040 --> 42:36.400
today His Majesty suddenly told your father that

42:36.720 --> 42:38.120
since you have a heart condition,

42:38.360 --> 42:39.800
you should stay home and rest.

42:40.040 --> 42:41.280
He also said some other things.

42:42.400 --> 42:43.040
Anyway,

42:43.640 --> 42:45.320
right in front of all the civil and military officials,

42:45.480 --> 42:46.800
he embarrassed your father badly.

42:47.080 --> 42:47.960
Luckily,

42:48.160 --> 42:49.400
the Earl of Yongchang came to discuss something with him.

42:49.520 --> 42:50.240
You need to leave

42:50.560 --> 42:51.680
before he comes to his senses

42:51.880 --> 42:52.920
and starts yelling at you again.

43:07.680 --> 43:08.360
My lord.

43:09.240 --> 43:09.760
Chen Yi.

43:13.640 --> 43:14.560
Young lord.
